    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; color: #1B2230; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; padding: 72px 45px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n\n<header style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; height: 72px\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-hvlc.png\" alt=\"Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center logo\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; object-position: left center\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px\">\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F3F7A\">INSURANCE, SERVICES &amp; LOCATION</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; color: #B3202A\">Se Habla Español</p>\n</div>\n<img src=\"assets/logo-ajpvc-division.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 64px; object-fit: contain; object-position: right center\">\n</header>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; background: #1F5FAD; color: #FFFFFF; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">INSURANCES ACCEPTED</h2>\n<div style=\"padding: 12px 10px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><span>Aetna</span><span>Blue Cross</span><span>Blue Shield</span><span>County of Kern Employees</span><span>Cigna</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><span>Great West</span><span>Humana PPO</span><span>Kern Health Systems</span><span>Medicare</span><span>Railroad Medicare</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><span>Tricare</span><span>TriWest</span><span>United Healthcare</span><span>Other Commercial Plans</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin: 18px 0 0; background: #1F5FAD; color: #FFFFFF; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">SERVICES PROVIDED</h2>\n<div style=\"padding: 12px 6px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1fr 1.15fr; column-gap: 20px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">CONSULT</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px\"><li>Cardiac</li><li>Vascular</li><li>Venous</li><li>Musculoskeletal (Joint Pain)</li><li>Hemorrhoid</li></ul></div>\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">OTHER SERVICES</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px\"><li>Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy (HBOT)</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">CARDIAC TESTING</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px\"><li>Echocardiogram / Stress Echo</li><li>Stress Test</li><li>EKG / Holter / Zio / Tele</li></ul></div>\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">VASCULAR TESTING</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px\"><li>Same-Day DVT Rule Out*</li><li>Venous &amp; Arterial Ultrasound</li><li>(ABI) Ankle Brachial Index / Stress ABI</li><li>(SPP) Skin Perfusion Pressure</li><li>Vein Mapping</li><li>Carotid Ultrasound</li><li>Renal Artery Ultrasound</li><li>Abdominal Aortic Ultrasound</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 10.5px; color: #4A5363\">*Available for most insurances.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">PROCEDURES</p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 15px\"><li>Cardiac Cath / Angioplasty / Stent</li><li>Lower Extremity Angio / Stent</li><li>Dialysis Fistulagram / Angioplasty / Stent</li><li>Venogram / Deep Vein Angioplasty / Stent</li><li>Vein Ablations: RFA, Venaseal, Varithena, Phlebectomy</li><li>Carotid Angiogram</li><li>IVC Filter and Removal</li><li style=\"font-weight: 700\">Plantar Fasciitis Embolization (PFE)</li><li style=\"font-weight: 700\">Genicular Artery Embolization (GAE) – Knee Arthritis</li><li style=\"font-weight: 700\">Transcatheter Arterial Micro-Embolization (TAME) – Hip, Shoulder &amp; Hand Pain</li><li style=\"font-weight: 700\">Hemorrhoidal Artery Embolization (HAE)</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; background: #1F5FAD; color: #FFFFFF; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">OUR PROVIDERS</h2>\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 6px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 0.85fr 1.25fr; column-gap: 20px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 700\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">PHYSICIANS</p><span>Vinod Kumar, MD, FACC, RPVI</span><span>Newton Phuong, MD</span><span>Mark Le, MD, RPVI</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">PHYSICIAN ASSISTANTS</p><span>Gerardo Murguia, PA-C</span><span>Adrian Rojas, PA</span><span>Noel Guido, PA-C</span><span>Jasleen Kaur, PA-C</span></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">NURSE PRACTITIONERS</p><span>Elsita Mathew, FNP-C</span><span>Magdalene Tanyi Epse Ayuk, FNP-C</span><span>Noemi Mitchell, FNP-C</span><span>Shahrzad Irani, FNP-C</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; background: #1F5FAD; color: #FFFFFF; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700\">LOCATIONS &amp; HOURS</h2>\n<div style=\"padding: 12px 6px 6px 18px; display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-end; flex: 1\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; font-size: 12.5px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: #1F3F7A\">Bakersfield (Main)</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0\">5020 Commerce Drive, Bakersfield, CA 93309</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; font-size: 12.5px; color: #1F3F7A\">Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center — satellite locations</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #4A5363\">For our current list of satellite offices, visit www.heartandleg.com or call the referral coordinator.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: #1F3F7A\">Monday – Friday, 8 AM – 6 PM</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex: none\">\n<img src=\"assets/qr-refer-online.png\" alt=\"QR code to refer a patient online\" style=\"width: 102px; height: 102px; display: block; image-rendering: pixelated\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F3F7A\">SCAN TO REFER ONLINE</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<footer style=\"background: #183A6B; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 7px 0 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700\">\n<span>REFERRAL COORDINATOR DIRECT LINE: (661) 459-9010</span>\n<span>APPOINTMENT LINE: 661-324-4100 &nbsp;•&nbsp; REFERRAL FAX: 661-324-4600 &nbsp;•&nbsp; www.heartandleg.com</span>\n</footer>\n</div>"
